    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "team_0115_select_01",
      "hash64": "A25337232FC84419",
      "text": "Director Clavell?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "team_0115_select_02",
      "hash64": "A25334232FC83F00",
      "text": "Clive?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_02a",
      "hash64": "774DCF241C0592DE",
      "text": "Oh, come on. The name’s Clive, remember?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_02b",
      "hash64": "774DCE241C05912B",
      "text": "Yup! That’s my name.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "4DAB8FDB987CC518",
      "text": "Actually...no. It’s time for me to bring this little\\nperformance to an end.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "4DAB96DB987CD0FD",
      "text": "Allow me to reveal my true identity![VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "4DAB95DB987CCF4A",
      "text": "Ha-hah![VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "4DAB94DB987CCD97",
      "text": "I do apologize for deceiving you with my disguise.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_07a",
      "hash64": "7757C3241C0DD2FF",
      "text": "In truth, the boy you knew as Clive was none\\nother than the director of Naranja Academy...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_07b",
      "hash64": "7757C4241C0DD4B2",
      "text": "In truth, the boy you knew as Clive was none\\nother than the director of Uva Academy...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "4DAB8ADB987CBC99",
      "text": "Mr. Clavell![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "team_0115_select_03",
      "hash64": "A25335232FC840B3",
      "text": "N-no way!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "team_0115_select_04",
      "hash64": "A2533A232FC84932",
      "text": "I already knew that",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_09a",
      "hash64": "7735C7241BF0F365",
      "text": "Yes, this must be quite the shock! My disguise\\nwas perfect, after all.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_09b",
      "hash64": "7735C4241BF0EE4C",
      "text": "What?! But my disguise was perfect!\\c\\nAlthough, now that I think about it...I did neglect\\nto keep up my youthful act on a few occasions.\\r\\nThat must have been what gave me away.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 179,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "4DA88CDB987A8A28",
      "text": "Regardless, there is still one more astonishing\\ntruth I must reveal to you.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "4DA88DDB987A8BDB",
      "text": "The true identity of Cassiopeia, the big boss of\\nTeam Star...was ME all along!!![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "team_0115_select_05",
      "hash64": "A2533B232FC84AE5",
      "text": "For real?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "team_0115_select_06",
      "hash64": "A25338232FC845CC",
      "text": "That’s impossible",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "4DA88EDB987A8D8E",
      "text": "Honest to goodness![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "4DA88FDB987A8F41",
      "text": "When you heard Cassiopeia over the phone,\\nthat was actually a prerecorded voice.\\c\\nI pulled it off using, er...you know, one of those...\\nhigh-tech gizmos! Oh yes, it was very clever![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 183,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "4DA890DB987A90F4",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]So, M[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0305)]asteriss [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Now\\nyou\\r\\nknow\\r\\nI’m\\r\\nthe\\r\\nbig\\r\\nboss!\\r\\nThat\\r\\nmeans\\r\\nthere\\r\\nis\\r\\njust\\r\\none\\r\\nthing\\r\\nleft\\r\\nto do![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
